Use these tools to inspect assigned issues and report worker progress/signals.

Retrieve an issue from the configured project management backend (beads, GitHub, etc.).

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__spur_worker_mcp__get_issue(args: {
  // Issue identifier
  id: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Use these tools to inspect assigned issues and report worker progress/signals.

Navigate the eligible Explore skill PageIndex. Without root, BM25-searches node tokens (query required). With root (skill_id or skill_id:node_id), expands one tree hop. Returns at most five metadata+lede hits; never full instruction bodies or filesystem installs.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__spur_worker_mcp__skill_navigate(args: {
  // When true, include node lede snippets. When false, omit lede fields.
  include_lede?: boolean;
  limit?: number;
  // Full-text query over skill PageIndex nodes. Required when root is omitted.
  query?: string;
  // Skill id or skill_id:node_id. When set, expand one tree hop instead of FTS.
  root?: string;
  source?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```
